    title: "Alarm Companies Leads: A Guide to Home Security Sales",
    metaTitle: "Alarm Companies Leads: Home Security Sales Guide",
    excerpt: "How home security and alarm companies source, price, and convert leads for monitored systems, and what separates a genuinely interested prospect from a tire-kicker.",
    metaDescription: "How alarm and home security companies find and convert leads, covering pricing, monitored versus DIY buyers, and the sales tactics that actually close deals.",
    category: "Home Services Marketing",
    readTime: "6 min read",
    publishedDate: "2026-08-23",
